 /// Store archive ownership and mode outside host inode metadata. Android app
 /// storage cannot chown files to guest UID 0 and clears setuid bits, while the
 /// PRoot USERLAND fake_id0 extension reads this per-path record to enforce the
 /// guest's real Unix ownership, permissions, and setuid behavior.
